  "details": "It's as simple as the title. Many of the performers which I work with and promote have QR-codes that are useless unless attendees scan with their phones on desktop or face their headset at the QR and use their phones on their monitors. A working QR-scanner in the game, with the necessary precautions taken such as a text warning so users won't be exploited because some QR's can be malicious in many ways. Perhaps only allowing scanning functionality for QR-codes placed in VRChat-trusted worlds who have access to the group store. The last work-around would be the creators themselves making the posters clickable leading to a website, but that takes away the purpose of the QR-code. So many possibilities, but we have to keep the user's safety the main priority.",
